---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<Layout title="Booking confirmed · MTD Back Office" noindex>
  <div class="container page">
    <h1>You're booked in.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Thanks for booking your free 30-minute admin check. Here's what happens next.</p>
    <ol class="next">
      <li>You'll get a confirmation email with the call details.</li>
      <li>On the call we look at what's slowing you down and what MTD means for you.</li>
      <li>If it's a fit, you get a one-page fixed-price proposal the same day.</li>
    </ol>
    <Button label="Back to home" href="/" />
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .next { margin-block: var(--space-6); padding-left: var(--space-6); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); max-width: 760px; }
</style>
